@gongshiyun/dsh-theme-claude-desktop README · Install：The plugin is an ordinary two-halved npm package: the host half (`lib/index.js`) only
contributes a mountable composition entry; all the work is in the client half
(`lib/client.js`).

@gongshiyun/dsh-theme-claude-desktop README · Fonts：**Install the Anthropic fonts and they are picked up automatically** — no configuration
needed. See
[matthieuhuguet/anthropic-fonts](https://github.com/matthieuhuguet/anthropic-fonts);
on Windows install the TTFs "for all users" and restart DSH.

@gongshiyun/dsh-theme-claude-desktop README · Compatibility：- DSH `>= 0.1.5-rc.1` (needs `ctx.theme.overrideTokens()` and the `dsh.client` two-halved
  package convention)
- Platform: `web`
- Dependencies: the `theme` client service only — no external module is `require`d, not even
  React

